Welcome to **__SITE_NAME__**.

This post is a Markdoc file living in `src/content/posts/`. Edit it in the
[Keystatic admin](/keystatic), or directly in your editor — both write to git.

## What you get

- Astro 5 with content collections (Zod-validated)
- React 19 islands with shadcn/ui components
- Keystatic CMS at `/keystatic`
- No database: git is the single source of truth
